===Alternative forms===
* {{w|Arabic numerals}}: [[13]]
* {{w|Roman numerals}}: [[XIII]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|thirttene}}, variant (through metathesis) of {{m|enm|thrittene}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þrēotīene}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*þritehun}}, compound of {{m|gem-pro|*þrīz|t=three}} + {{m|gem-pro|*tehun|t=teen}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|trettjin}}, {{cog|nl|dertien}}, {{cog|de|dreizehn}}, {{cog|da|tretten}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|three|teen}}.

